Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.85,0:19:24.35,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fn思源宋体 CN Heavy\fax0.06\1c&H231817&\fs50\frx358\fry358\frz356.1\pos(817.486,190.457)}前方一般人员禁止进入
